    <item>
      <title>杠铃：一头极稳，一头极冒险</title>
      <link>https://read-and-build-vkkc4zaaicr.qoder.website/blog/barbell-strategy.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://read-and-build-vkkc4zaaicr.qoder.website/blog/barbell-strategy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>泰勒斯用一点定金租下所有榨油机，对了大赚、错了小亏。杠铃策略不是 50 对 50，而是 90 对 10：大头极稳，小头极敢，中间地带最要小心。</description>
